/* Applied before first paint so a stored theme choice does not flash the other
   one. Absence of a value is meaningful: it means "follow the OS". */
/* The app applies a stored theme choice before first paint via a blocking inline
   script in its layout; carried over verbatim so a viewer who toggles the theme
   here and reloads does not get a flash of the other one. Absence of a stored
   value is meaningful — it means "follow the OS", which the CSS handles. */
